From a0840c3fab971c9dd2c6d1d7e1e84b0367b869a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agnya <manthram@Pradass-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:53:46 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix accent-hover/accent-subtle silently not working
 sitewide
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

colors.accent was defined twice in tailwind.config.ts: once as the
ocean-blue brand token (DEFAULT/hover/subtle), once again further
down for shadcn's CSS-variable-driven semantic color (DEFAULT/
foreground, used by 9 shadcn UI primitives for hover/focus states).
In a JS object literal the second key wins outright, so the whole
first definition — including hover and subtle — was silently
discarded. accent-hover and accent-subtle classes resolved to
nothing anywhere they were used.

Found this while auditing the profile page's colors: 6 files already
use accent-hover/accent-subtle (some edited earlier in this session)
and have been silently missing that styling the whole time.

Merged both into one accent definition: DEFAULT/foreground stay
CSS-variable driven (needed by the shadcn primitives; --accent
already resolves to ocean blue in light mode, so no visible change
there), hover/subtle are restored as static values so brand-system
pages get real ocean-blue hover/tint variants again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tailwind.config.ts | 11 ++++++-----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tailwind.config.ts b/tailwind.config.ts
index 507ec41..0d31863 100644
--- a/tailwind.config.ts
+++ b/tailwind.config.ts
@@ -20,7 +20,12 @@ export default {
           subtle: "hsl(351 70% 96%)",  // light background tint
         },
         accent: {
-          DEFAULT: "hsl(202 48% 48%)", // #3F8AB4 - ocean blue
+          // DEFAULT/foreground stay CSS-variable driven (shadcn UI primitives
+          // depend on this); --accent resolves to ocean blue #3F8AB4 in light
+          // mode. hover/subtle are static so brand-system pages can use them
+          // regardless of theme.
+          DEFAULT: "var(--accent)",
+          foreground: "var(--accent-foreground)",
           hover: "hsl(202 48% 38%)",   // darker ocean
           subtle: "hsl(202 48% 95%)",  // light ocean tint
         },
@@ -72,10 +77,6 @@ export default {
           DEFAULT: "var(--muted)",
           foreground: "var(--muted-foreground)",
         },
-        accent: {
-          DEFAULT: "var(--accent)",
-          foreground: "var(--accent-foreground)",
-        },
         destructive: {
           DEFAULT: "var(--destructive)",
           foreground: "var(--destructive-foreground)",
-- 
